  <title lang="en">Kleptography: SETUP Attack on RSA</title>
  <summary lang="en"><i>Kleptography: SETUP Attack on RSA</i></summary>
  <description lang="en">A changed RSA key generator hides the prime p in the key; the attacker reads it.</description>
  <keywords lang="en">kleptography, SETUP, backdoor, RSA, key generation</keywords>
